        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>If the scene tracker iterates every time the environment takes a turn that favors larger groups. How do you guys compensate for that say in a 2 hero game?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I know some things scale like x minions per hero&nbsp;but there are a lot of scenes where there are elements that don't scale &nbsp;and those elements usual are essential to succeeding.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Say a scene essentially requires 10 overcome attempts to succeed. If the heroes concentrate on the overcomes this will take 2 heroes 5 rounds but it will take 5 heroes 2 rounds. 5 rounds&nbsp;of taking attacks without defense or fighting back is brutal compared to just 2.&nbsp;</p>",
