      {
        "id": 230351,
        "name": "ErekLich",
        "username": "ErekLich",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/f6c823/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-04-25T17:40:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The pre-written modules have this problem, yes.&nbsp; While they do provide rules for scaling the number of bad guys they didn't scale the Overcome stuff, and it really means that you ideally want to run them with 4 players minimum, or else houserule reduce the number of overcomes required.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>That said, the actual encounter-building guidelines that have been released to backers do have extensive notes on how to properly scale all elements of the encounter to H, and hopefully future published modules will provide better guidance on the subject as well.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:05:19.522Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
